Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heat Haze Palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's unclear how true it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's said that the manor was once a hideout\Nbelonging to the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and was a palace in every sense of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing works!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your wire trap today was well-executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could feel your training paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hooray?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the fact you aren't being as elegant and graceful as\Na seafowl's plumage as it soars through a zephyr
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is really kind of disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't follow a word of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but I could tell he was saying\Nwe fell short of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We really are washouts, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've already been here for over ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But every day, we keep losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We suck, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of you are getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just so powerful it's hard to tell, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be looking forward to your next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! At least untie the damn wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Undo them yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Consider it part of your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the wires didn't leave a single mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a professional for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Color me surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:03:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never figured a meathead gorilla like you\Nwould care about that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who you callin' a gorilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I had to pick someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You would have expected me\Nto be the one who was concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, seduction is her area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I wasn't too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of men who get turned on\Nby rope burns and such in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, for someone who likes to play the cynic,\Nyou're actually surprisingly childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me? I'll have you know I-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,L-let's just drop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it when conversations get all raunchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what should we\Ndo for our next attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been giving it some thought,\Nand I say we all head into town together and-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to be so fixated\Non working as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might be a good idea for us each\Nto try our own thing for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There isn't any rule that says\Nwe always have to attack him as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You cool with that, Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The bath's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roger that, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The younger group will head on in, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's have a contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll see who can stay underwater the longest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take my bath alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see, that's what you were talking about in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's not a rule or anything,\Nbut we don't have long before the Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You would think that developing our teamwork\Nwould be priority number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were able to work together with\Nsome success the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't change the fact that Lamplight is\Nan ad hoc team that only just came together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what's more, many of us have loud personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Getting us all on the same page\Nwill be easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Getting in some solo training at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your efforts are commendable, Sybilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the team leader, what's a girl to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to talk, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is what your room looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The furnishings are all so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to get the corner room,\Nbut you went and snatched it up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I won that lottery fair and square-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While I have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think that you, of all people,\Nwould be such a late bloomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whether or not you have any actual experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,your academy should have at least\Ntaught you the basics of seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would have assumed it was right up your alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have a cunning streak a mile long\Nand a heart devoid of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fl-flattery will get you nowhere, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You even have the perfect assets for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, this will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you a makeover, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say to taking Teach down\Nwith some seduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Men like him tend to go for the bashful, innocent type
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,over more confident women like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That flirtatious blush you're going for\Nright now is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not going for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think of how impressed we would be\Nif you got Teach to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"That's our leader for you!" we'd all say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you can talk it up all you like-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll do it for us, won't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-so, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need your help, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Big Brother"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that I\Nwas your little sister in a past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I was also a maid who loved serving you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and every night, I would give you a massage\Nto ease your fatigue, just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, come on, lie down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, if you drink this before I start,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it will make the massage twice as effective, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, how much longer should\NI keep playing along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If there's something troubling you,\NI'd be happy to lend you an ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please just forget this ever happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I told her I didn't want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about Miss Thea?\NWhat did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, get a load of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I expected about as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to say, that man has the self-control of a monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all but unthinkable, from a man of his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, how old is Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the valuable data, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to go along, but seduction is her specialty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I figured she knew what she was-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's only the inside of the manor that's bugged,\Nso I think you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That aside, it's nice how you young'uns\Nare working together so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think Erna and Annette\Nreally hit it off the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She keeps laying traps all over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I keep getting caught in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It just happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep, yeep, yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I hear that was a problem at her academy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She got good grades,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but she kept messing around and\Nbuilding bizarre spy tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely, she's just setting the traps\Nto make Teach say "I surrender," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's doing it to torment me\Nso she can have a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.67,0:09:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's dead to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's tail her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be hard to get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but the carpet is bulging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is? I don't see any-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's just really susceptible to that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I feel like she walked into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not on purpose, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's you again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's annoying, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want someone else to get caught for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are you the person who's complaining here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:32.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's probably six of one, half dozen of the other.\N{\rSubtitle-3}I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's probably six of one, half dozen of the other.\N{\rSubtitle-3}I want an apology, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything really to worry about.\N{\rSubtitle-3}Now you're just talking nonsense, yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The team's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Impossible Mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is gonna wipe us all out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not when we've only just met,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and not when I finally have a chance\Nto escape how things were
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and bloom into someone I can be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I brought you some dinner, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should head back to your room\Nand get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be tired from being out so late,\Nso I should at least serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.75,0:11:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.\NYou should really go-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would very much like to serve you your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You making it was already more than kind enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was he worried that I was going to attack him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I honestly just wanted to serve him dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nhas Teach ever eaten a meal with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He always cooks for one and eats alone in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I've got a plan that\Nmight just be worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got trounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ran into Klaus at the firing range earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and he gave me some one-on-one coaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's play Russian Roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make you say, "I surrender," for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before we start, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you should put that bullet you just\Nslipped out of the chamber back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Put it back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I actually challenged him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With the way billiards works,\NI was so sure I had it in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that have something to do\Nwith your special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one you haven't told us about yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we take Teach on separately,\Nhe's just going to crush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I, Wunderkind Lily, came up with a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Wunderkind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just ignore that part.\NLet her have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Wunderkind or not,\NI won't be able to carry it out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need everyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say?\NWill you lend me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not like we've got much of a choice, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seconded.\NWe all in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach has a mission today,\Nso he'll be heading into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When he does...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The target stopped by a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The target left the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Resuming pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That figures, but we planned for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told Mr. Bernard to stay far enough back\Nthat Teach doesn't notice him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we make him believe he gave us the slip,\Neven a pro's gonna let his guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B Team, use Mr. Bernard as a landmark\Nand follow Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Daughter Dearest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to one of the restaurant's employees,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the boss has some foods he can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That patron didn't finish his espresso.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He might have had a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw him clutching at his belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Dreamspeaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The target is looking at some ingredients and frowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Glint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The target boarded a train at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,His mission today is probably in another town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All units, return to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Send out the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:15:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aye aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone's hard work,\Nwe were able to score some valuable intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to my hypothesis,\Nthe reason Teach never eats with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is 'cuz he's got food allergies, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go stealing your leader's thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the kind of information\Na spy wouldn't want people to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That checks out, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we'd better get started, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-hem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, let's get cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.25,0:16:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are some fancy knife skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get out of my face.\NYou're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, I didn't know you were so handy in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cooking is a basic spy skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the tournée-cut carrots, do these look all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.75,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Looks like everything's going smoothly over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:10.92,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,The problem is those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to be careful when I'm frying the shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a great tool to grind them up with, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?! That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do your inventions all have to be so destructive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got some sauce on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, let me get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,K-keep your hands to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even when she acts mad like that,\Nshe's actually enjoying herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, you two, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The others are almost done with the soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I was thinking we could get started\Nmaking a milk pudding to have for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of them really are adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lily, what gives?\NYou haven't been helpin' anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the supervisor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or, like, the cheerleader?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get working, dammit!\NGo set the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, the meat's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all made this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We figured you'd be\Ntuckered out from your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your subordinates cooked it for you\Nout of the goodness of their hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and packed it full of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.46,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Based on what we learned from tailing him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:39.00,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...Klaus's weaknesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:40.58,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...that is, the foods he avoids...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:41.58,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...are beef...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:44.00,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,...shrimp, and anything with dairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.75,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:46.96,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Eat it up, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:49.13,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Either that, or surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was just what I was craving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It... It was to your liking, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold up, that ain't good at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell's goin' on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He pulled one over on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He knew everything we were up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All those things we learned while tailing him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...were stuff he wanted us to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That conversation those waiters had\Nwas probably his doing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We got carried away and cooked way too much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh! I'm starving, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.04,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Taking into account what I learned today,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.33,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,the best way to split up the team\Nwould be into those three groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.42,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Meals are something you eat with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:59.46,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,The more you share the same table,\Nthe deeper your bonds grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really screwed the pooch on this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're really accepting someone like me\Nas your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, basically.\NI mean, Klaus did appoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.75,0:20:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That guy pisses me the hell off!\NThe way he's always so goddamn composed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, how old is he even?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I actually know this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I asked him when we were out shopping together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shit, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's basically the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just thought up a plan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a special new creation up my sleeve for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time, we'll make Teach surrender for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Together, as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!\N{\rSubtitle-5}Yeep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:55.33,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I expect they'll be spending the evening in high spirits\Nstrengthening their bonds with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.75,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,It will be cozy, like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:04.58,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,But my family, Inferno, is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:09.92,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Now, I've lost my reason to share a table with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leader, do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:21.04,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Leader!\N{\rSubtitle}Leader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:22.46,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Leader!\N{\rSubtitle}Leader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it, on it, on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A trusty leader's day starts early,\Nand the work never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From the way you're acting,\NI guess you managed to quash your worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? I was worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got something you wanna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never change, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That indominable spirit of yours is your greatest virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna indomitably herald a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With Wunderkind Lily at its head,\NLamplight's going to lead the charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would expect nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure you all train hard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our inaugural Impossible Mission\Nis just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it!
